        "root_cause": "The release evaluator loads exact tools/gate_a_1_2_3.py bytes in a separate module namespace. That loaded contract owns its own branch literal and GateError class, and its verify_identity rejects the successor branch. The release evaluator calls that function outside translated_error, so its outer GateError handler does not recognize the module-local exception and the generic boundary emits GA123I-INTERNAL-FAILURE. The separate 1.2.2 result corroborates the branch mismatch but is not the causal loaded module for the 1.2.3 launcher failure."
